<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Way — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7f9f6;--accent:#5b9873;--muted:#606159;--ink:#222}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 22px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    .hero{padding:34px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),transparent);}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .frame{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
    .pillar{flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
    .reveal.is-revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
    .planner{margin-top:16px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-top:8px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .summary{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.06);font-family:monospace}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Hearth</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
      <a href="approach.html" aria-current="page">Way</a>
      <a href="about.html">Seed</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="0">
        <h1>A simple structure for complex lives</h1>
        <p class="muted">We favor one small experiment at a time: observe, try, measure, adjust. The method is steady and forgiving.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="frame">
        <div class="pillar reveal" data-delay="80">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Listen</h3>
          <p class="muted">We map history and context so recommendations fit your routines and limits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar reveal" data-delay="160">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Design</h3>
          <p class="muted">Actions are bite-sized and measurable — something you can try this week.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar reveal" data-delay="240">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Adapt</h3>
          <p class="muted">We watch effects and adjust; plans are built to be revised, not perfected.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:22px">
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="320">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0">The framework</h2>
        <ol class="muted">
          <li style="margin:8px 0">Map — timeline, rhythms, and current supports.</li>
          <li style="margin:8px 0">Choose — one small test with a clear measure.</li>
          <li style="margin:8px 0">Repeat — a short review and a next step.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" data-delay="400">
        <h3>Session Planner</h3>
